#: lib/install-selection.sh:169
msgid ""
"Installs the WMI hotkey daemon for ScreenPad brightness, fan Quiet/Balanced/"
"Performance, camera privacy, and window swap across monitors."
msgstr ""
"Namesti demona vročih tipk WMI za svetlost ScreenPad, ventilator Quiet/"
"Balanced/Performance, zasebnost kamere in zamenjavo oken med zasloni."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:173
msgid ""
"Installs the speaker amplifier fix and a suspend/resume hook so supported "
"ZenBook audio recovers after boot and after sleep."
msgstr ""
"Namesti popravek ojačevalnika zvočnikov in kljuko suspend/resume, da se "
"podprti zvok ZenBook obnovi po zagonu in po spanju."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:171
msgid ""
"Installs the touchpad Share gesture listener so a top-left corner tap opens "
"your desktop screenshot tool (GNOME, Spectacle, and peers)."
msgstr ""
"Namesti poslušalca geste Share sledilne ploščice, da tip v zgornjem levem "
"kotu odpre orodje za zajem zaslona namizja (GNOME, Spectacle in podobno)."

